{
  "timothy2.4.p1.b1": {
    "text": "我在　神面前，并在将来审判活人死人的基督耶稣面前，……嘱咐你：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠在　神面⁠前，并在将⁠来审⁠判活⁠人死⁠人的基⁠督耶⁠稣面⁠前，……嘱⁠咐你："
  },
  "timothy2.4.p1.b2": {
    "text": "务要传道，无论得时不得时总要专心，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "务要传⁠道，无⁠论得时不⁠得时总要专⁠心，"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p1.b3": {
    "text": "并用百般的忍耐、各样的教训责备人，警戒人，劝勉人。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "并用百⁠般的忍⁠耐、各⁠样的教⁠训责⁠备人，警⁠戒人，劝⁠勉人。"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p2.b1": {
    "text": "因为时候要到，人必厌烦纯正的道理，耳朵发痒，……",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "因⁠为时⁠候要⁠到，人必厌⁠烦纯⁠正的道⁠理，耳⁠朵发⁠痒，……"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p2.b2": {
    "text": "并且掩耳不听真道，偏向荒渺的言语。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "并⁠且掩⁠耳不听真⁠道，偏⁠向荒渺的言⁠语。"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p2.b3": {
    "text": "你却要凡事谨慎，忍受苦难，……",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你却⁠要凡⁠事谨⁠慎，忍⁠受苦⁠难，……"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p2.b4": {
    "text": "……做传道的工夫，尽你的职分。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "……做传⁠道的工⁠夫，尽你⁠的职分。"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p3.b1": {
    "text": "我现在被浇奠，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我现⁠在被浇奠，"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p3.b2": {
    "text": "我离世的时候到了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我离世的时⁠候到⁠了。"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p4.b1": {
    "text": "那美好的仗我已经打过了，当跑的路我已经跑尽了，所信的道我已经守住了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那美⁠好的仗我已⁠经打过了，当跑的路我已⁠经跑尽了，所⁠信的道我已⁠经守⁠住了。"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p4.b2": {
    "text": "从此以后，有公义的冠冕为我存留，……",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "从⁠此以⁠后，有公⁠义的冠⁠冕为⁠我存⁠留，……"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p4.b3": {
    "text": "不但赐给我，也赐给凡爱慕他显现的人。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "不⁠但赐⁠给我，也赐⁠给凡爱⁠慕他显⁠现的人。"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p5.b1": {
    "text": "你要赶紧地到我这里来。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠要赶⁠紧地到我这⁠里来。"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p5.b2": {
    "text": "因为底马贪爱现今的世界，就离弃我往帖撒罗尼迦去了；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "因⁠为底马贪爱现⁠今的世⁠界，就离⁠弃我往帖撒罗尼迦去⁠了；"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p5.b3": {
    "text": "革勒士往加拉太去；提多往挞马太去；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "革勒士往加拉太去；提多往挞马⁠太去；"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p5.b4": {
    "text": "独有路加在我这里。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "独有路⁠加在我这⁠里。"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p6.b1": {
    "text": "我在特罗亚留于加布的那件外衣，你来的时候可以带来，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠在特罗亚留于加⁠布的那⁠件外⁠衣，你⁠来的时⁠候可⁠以带⁠来，"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p6.b2": {
    "text": "那些书也要带来，更要紧的是那些皮卷。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那⁠些书也⁠要带⁠来，更要⁠紧的⁠是那⁠些皮卷。"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p6.b3": {
    "text": "铜匠亚历山大多多地害我；主必照他所行的报应他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "铜⁠匠亚⁠历山⁠大多⁠多地害我；主必照他⁠所行的报⁠应他。"
  },
  "timothy2.4.p6.b4": {
    "text": "你也要防备他，……",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "2 Timothy 4:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你也⁠要防⁠备他，……"
  }
}
